WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:47.875
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:48.145 --> 01:50.585
Isn't that one of the mangoes Zheng Yu gave us?

3
01:50.665 --> 01:52.145
What are you doing?

4
01:52.225 --> 01:54.545
I was too impatient last time and ate one too early.

5
01:54.625 --> 01:56.225
It was a bit astringent,

6
01:56.305 --> 01:59.225
so I'm examining it closely to see if it's ready yet.

7
01:59.305 --> 02:03.225
Someone might think you're going to write a paper and submit it for publication.

8
02:03.305 --> 02:05.145
Does eating fruit require the right timing?

9
02:05.225 --> 02:06.505
Of course.

10
02:06.585 --> 02:08.785
It's just like falling in love.

11
02:08.864 --> 02:10.864
If you force it at the wrong time,

12
02:10.945 --> 02:15.145
all your wonderful expectations will turn into ruin and resentment.

13
02:15.665 --> 02:17.785
You sound like a love expert.

14
02:18.745 --> 02:19.945
Xu Fangli,

15
02:20.025 --> 02:23.865
the next time I give you fruit, you had better cherish it like this too.

16
02:40.225 --> 02:44.865
JIANG HAIXING DIGITAL REPAIR

17
02:55.425 --> 02:56.705
What needs fixing?

18
03:00.865 --> 03:02.985
We don't have much. Make do with a bite.

19
03:04.545 --> 03:06.545
What brings you two here?

20
03:08.545 --> 03:09.905
It's hard to get by here.

21
03:10.505 --> 03:13.345
The two of us even have to keep coming back here.

22
03:13.425 --> 03:15.265
You should know why, right?

23
03:22.105 --> 03:23.705
In the beginning,

24
03:23.785 --> 03:28.185
it was because she was your niece that we agreed to lend her money.

25
03:28.785 --> 03:31.785
Otherwise, who would lend so much money to a kid?

26
03:33.785 --> 03:35.705
FAST REPAIRS OF PHONES AND DIGITAL DEVICES

27
03:35.785 --> 03:38.185
It's no use telling me this.

28
03:38.265 --> 03:39.105
You…

29
03:43.145 --> 03:45.545
We didn't come to demand money from you.

30
03:45.625 --> 03:47.505
You don't have to be so wary of us.

31
03:48.105 --> 03:49.345
This city is so big.

32
03:49.425 --> 03:50.785
As her uncle,

33
03:50.865 --> 03:53.145
you must know where she studies.

34
03:56.105 --> 03:57.905
I… I really don't know.

35
03:59.025 --> 04:01.425
Think about it. She's a natural freeloader.

36
04:02.185 --> 04:05.945
I avoid her like the plague. You know that's true.

37
04:07.345 --> 04:10.305
Actually, waiting for her at her university

38
04:10.385 --> 04:12.065
is one way to get money.

39
04:12.145 --> 04:16.105
But how much money could a broke student have?

40
04:16.184 --> 04:17.745
She can't play any tricks.

41
04:18.465 --> 04:19.905
If you ask me,

42
04:21.105 --> 04:22.665
let her save some face.

43
04:22.745 --> 04:25.625
She has good grades.

44
04:25.705 --> 04:28.225
She will make bank in the future.

45
04:28.305 --> 04:30.705
Once that happens, you can get all you want.

46
04:31.745 --> 04:33.185
The food will get cold. Eat.

47
04:35.265 --> 04:36.385
Here.

48
04:56.305 --> 04:59.425
BIOLOGY NOTES

49
05:03.145 --> 05:04.385
What are you looking at?

50
05:05.305 --> 05:07.545
Your tutor really cares about you,

51
05:08.305 --> 05:09.865
even writing notes for you.

52
05:10.745 --> 05:12.145
I paid her, after all.

53
05:12.745 --> 05:16.105
I definitely pay Ms. Zheng more than the market rate.

54
05:17.465 --> 05:18.745
What's with that reaction?

55
05:21.705 --> 05:22.785
I envy you.

56
05:23.505 --> 05:26.105
I envy the fact that you can buy other people's time.

57
05:26.945 --> 05:30.265
And I envy you. You get my time without spending money.

58
05:34.625 --> 05:36.865
You studied through the lunch hour.

59
05:36.945 --> 05:38.145
No one sat with you.

60
05:38.745 --> 05:41.505
It's sad. That's why I came over.

61
05:42.745 --> 05:44.785
I'll be your study partner for free.

62
05:44.865 --> 05:45.985
Cherish it.

63
05:55.185 --> 05:56.825
Do you have one of these too?

64
05:58.465 --> 06:00.265
-Yes. -Show me.

65
06:01.625 --> 06:02.865
Why?

66
06:03.905 --> 06:06.025
Mine only has biology.

67
06:06.105 --> 06:08.585
But I want to improve my math.

68
06:08.665 --> 06:09.945
Yours must have a list

69
06:10.025 --> 06:11.985
of review materials for math, right?

70
06:12.065 --> 06:13.105
Yes.

71
06:20.465 --> 06:22.545
I don't think I brought it. It's at home.

72
06:24.505 --> 06:25.345
Stingy.

73
06:36.745 --> 06:39.745
Laowu. Wu Fa, here's to you.

74
06:40.345 --> 06:44.785
Thank you for not giving me a hard time over the years.

75
06:45.985 --> 06:48.665
We grew up together.

76
06:48.745 --> 06:50.385
Give you a hard time?

77
06:50.465 --> 06:52.385
You make it sound so terrible.

78
07:08.825 --> 07:13.105
BOOK LIST FOR SCHOOL 1. MUST-BUY, 2. FOR REFERENCE

79
07:27.625 --> 07:28.505
Chen Yanzhou.

80
07:36.265 --> 07:38.265
I sang too much,

81
07:38.345 --> 07:40.065
and my voice turned hoarse.

82
07:40.145 --> 07:40.985
What about you?

83
07:42.025 --> 07:44.825
Did you lose your voice from that birthday party?

84
07:49.985 --> 07:50.865
Zheng Yu.

85
07:52.625 --> 07:53.825
Zheng Yu.

86
07:57.345 --> 07:58.265
Fine.

87
07:58.865 --> 08:00.185
Team building.

88
08:00.265 --> 08:02.345
If you don't talk, I won't talk either.

89
08:11.385 --> 08:12.545
Welcome.

90
08:13.625 --> 08:16.425
Give… Give me a few of these fish balls.

91
08:16.505 --> 08:17.785
Just a moment.

92
08:22.545 --> 08:23.505
Bro.

93
08:24.705 --> 08:27.185
I think Jiang Haixing is right.

94
08:27.265 --> 08:29.345
She's a broke student.

95
08:29.425 --> 08:32.225
Even if we push her, where will she get so much money?

96
08:34.024 --> 08:36.105
Jiang Haixing wouldn't tell us where she's studying

97
08:36.185 --> 08:39.825
because he's afraid his niece will turn and ask him for money.

98
08:40.985 --> 08:42.865
Whether he gives it is another matter.

99
08:42.945 --> 08:47.025
Would his adopted son just leave his biological sister hanging?

100
08:49.145 --> 08:50.465
What else did he say?

101
08:50.545 --> 08:52.425
She will make bank in the future?

102
08:52.505 --> 08:55.385
What if she finds a job and runs far away?

103
08:55.465 --> 08:56.305
What will we do?

104
08:56.385 --> 08:58.385
Chase her across the world?

105
08:58.465 --> 08:59.905
You're right.

106
09:00.665 --> 09:03.105
But the university is so big. Where will we find her?

107
09:03.185 --> 09:05.465
Zheng Yu is good at hiding.

108
09:06.785 --> 09:08.785
No rush. We'll search slowly.

109
09:08.865 --> 09:10.985
She won't be getting away.

110
09:21.265 --> 09:23.665
ZHENG YU

111
09:25.105 --> 09:27.825
Bi Dezheng, that's Zheng Yu's phone. Bring it to her.

112
09:28.425 --> 09:29.505
You bring it to her.

113
09:33.225 --> 09:35.985
It's not that I don't want to. She went to the restroom.

114
09:36.065 --> 09:37.265
Just wait.

115
09:38.145 --> 09:39.865
I'm going to get my food delivery.

116
09:45.905 --> 09:48.025
ZHENG YU

117
09:49.825 --> 09:52.025
Could it be the hospital?

118
09:59.425 --> 10:00.865
Zheng Yu, are you on campus?

119
10:00.945 --> 10:03.665
Two thugs are at the convenience store asking around for you.

120
10:03.745 --> 10:04.825
They want money from you.

121
10:04.905 --> 10:07.985
They're at the entrance. I'm telling you, be careful.

122
10:12.105 --> 10:13.785
What's up?

123
10:16.545 --> 10:18.665
Could she leave from another entrance?

124
10:18.745 --> 10:20.105
Let's keep looking.

125
10:34.665 --> 10:35.705
Who are you?

126
10:35.785 --> 10:36.625
Wait.

127
10:37.625 --> 10:41.345
I remember you. I saw you at the hospital ward.

128
10:42.105 --> 10:43.625
We meet again.

129
10:43.705 --> 10:44.985
Perfect.

130
10:45.065 --> 10:46.385
Where is Zheng Yu?

131
10:46.985 --> 10:50.025
Let's cut to the chase. What will it take for you to leave?

132
10:55.945 --> 10:59.625
Two guys who look like debt collectors are heading to campus.

133
11:00.505 --> 11:01.385
Got it.

134
11:01.465 --> 11:03.105
Your classmate answered my call.

135
11:03.185 --> 11:04.025
Did you see him?

136
11:04.105 --> 11:07.145
LU SIQUAN (STORE MANAGER)

137
11:08.265 --> 11:09.265
Not yet.

138
11:12.345 --> 11:13.905
-Where are they? -Gone.

139
11:14.505 --> 11:15.705
Gone?

140
11:18.385 --> 11:19.865
They haven't even seen me,

141
11:19.945 --> 11:21.065
and they just left?

142
11:21.705 --> 11:22.705
What did you say?

143
11:24.545 --> 11:25.785
Nothing much.

144
11:26.785 --> 11:29.025
With a guy spending money on you,

145
11:29.105 --> 11:33.145
will you be paying off your debt faster now?

146
11:33.225 --> 11:34.305
You gave them money?

147
11:38.585 --> 11:39.545
How much?

148
11:42.825 --> 11:43.825
How much?

149
11:47.225 --> 11:48.865
Ten thousand yuan.

150
11:52.185 --> 11:53.825
I don't have that much right now.

151
11:54.425 --> 11:56.505
I get paid next week for a translation gig.

152
11:56.585 --> 11:58.185
Altogether, I'll have…

153
11:58.265 --> 11:59.905
Don't send it to me.

154
12:02.505 --> 12:03.665
Save it for later.

155
12:07.985 --> 12:09.625
When is later?

156
12:10.265 --> 12:12.025
When I pay off my debt,

157
12:12.905 --> 12:14.745
or when I don't have hospital bills?

158
12:23.465 --> 12:24.905
I'll send this much for now.

159
12:25.745 --> 12:27.425
Do you have to be like this?

160
12:33.505 --> 12:35.705
Do you know why I pretended to have blacked out?

161
12:36.425 --> 12:38.985
Because at some point,

162
12:40.265 --> 12:42.585
my self-respect seemed to have returned.

163
12:44.305 --> 12:45.905
But I drank alcohol that day

164
12:47.585 --> 12:50.425
and did things that compromised my self-respect.

165
12:52.465 --> 12:54.105
I really regret it.

166
12:55.345 --> 12:56.705
So I want to forget it.

167
14:21.625 --> 14:23.785
Contact me if there are any gigs.

168
14:23.865 --> 14:24.945
PART-TIME JOB GROUP

169
14:25.025 --> 14:26.825
GIG CONNECTIONS, GIGS FOR FRIENDS

170
14:32.025 --> 14:34.225
Because at some point,

171
14:35.545 --> 14:37.585
my self-respect seemed to have returned.

172
14:38.825 --> 14:40.585
But I drank alcohol that day

173
14:40.665 --> 14:43.225
and did things that compromised my self-respect.

174
14:44.105 --> 14:45.545
I really regret it.

175
14:45.625 --> 14:46.945
So I want to forget it.

176
15:09.505 --> 15:10.745
You're back.

177
15:16.745 --> 15:18.465
Mom, doing a big cleanout?

178
15:19.065 --> 15:20.305
No.

179
15:20.385 --> 15:24.705
In the community across from us, I met a cleaning lady.

180
15:24.785 --> 15:26.665
She likes to collect junk to sell.

181
15:27.265 --> 15:29.025
I thought I could give her some.

182
15:31.265 --> 15:32.265
Do you need my help?

183
15:32.345 --> 15:33.505
No.

184
15:34.585 --> 15:36.345
But here are some of your books.

185
15:36.425 --> 15:37.665
See if you want them.

186
15:39.265 --> 15:42.305
Those are from senior high school. They are no longer of use.

187
15:42.385 --> 15:43.585
Okay.

188
15:43.665 --> 15:45.225
There are also these.

189
15:45.305 --> 15:46.785
I saw them in your study.

190
15:46.865 --> 15:49.585
There was a thick layer of dust.

191
15:49.665 --> 15:53.705
But they look like college textbooks.

192
15:53.785 --> 15:54.625
Look.

193
15:54.705 --> 15:55.825
FUNDAMENTALS OF BIOMEDICINE

194
15:55.905 --> 15:57.905
Do you use these books in Life Sciences?

195
16:00.145 --> 16:02.425
I was bored and bought them for fun.

196
16:03.305 --> 16:04.185
I don't need them.

197
16:06.185 --> 16:07.105
Okay.

198
16:07.825 --> 16:08.825
I'll give them away.

199
16:10.185 --> 16:12.105
If that's all, I'm going to go, Mom.

200
16:12.185 --> 16:13.345
Okay.

201
16:15.705 --> 16:16.825
Yanzhou.

202
16:17.625 --> 16:20.545
It's your birthday soon. How do you want to spend it?

203
16:21.145 --> 16:22.145
My birthday?

204
16:26.225 --> 16:28.425
The same as usual. Just dinner at home.

205
16:29.025 --> 16:31.145
Okay. I'll get your dad to buy a big cake.

206
16:32.625 --> 16:35.465
I remember your wish last year was to finish your thesis.

207
16:35.545 --> 16:37.505
It has come true, right?

208
16:39.745 --> 16:42.465
Wonderful. Make more wishes this year. It really works.

209
16:53.705 --> 16:55.145
Directly rejected?

210
16:55.225 --> 16:57.185
Didn't the editor ask you to edit it?

211
16:59.265 --> 17:00.185
No.

212
17:02.665 --> 17:06.025
I should've warned you when you wanted to submit to Molecular Plant.

213
17:07.224 --> 17:08.865
Even for graduate students,

214
17:09.545 --> 17:11.585
the chances of getting published are low.

215
17:12.385 --> 17:16.065
Why don't you try again with a publisher with a lower threshold?

216
17:16.145 --> 17:18.105
If it doesn't pass, let's just give up.

217
17:21.704 --> 17:24.625
This direction of research was your brother's interest.

218
17:25.224 --> 17:27.025
But so much time has passed.

219
17:27.105 --> 17:28.585
I think you should…

220
17:28.665 --> 17:30.225
I came to tell you

221
17:31.145 --> 17:33.425
that I will continue to revise and resubmit.

222
17:33.505 --> 17:35.585
I will also send the editor an explanation.

223
17:36.945 --> 17:38.745
Do you know how slim the chances are

224
17:38.825 --> 17:40.505
for a rejected paper

225
17:40.585 --> 17:42.625
that is resubmitted to the same journal?

226
17:42.705 --> 17:43.545
I know.

227
17:53.625 --> 17:55.065
Why are you so late today?

228
17:56.065 --> 17:57.225
Zheng Yu came in early.

229
17:57.305 --> 17:58.465
She just left.

230
18:03.985 --> 18:06.945
Did you two agree to take different shifts?

231
18:24.385 --> 18:27.225
Dezheng, you've been quite diligent with your experiments.

232
18:29.505 --> 18:30.625
Divorce is looming.

233
18:31.225 --> 18:33.345
It's up to me to hold this family together.

234
18:37.545 --> 18:38.785
Carry on.

235
18:44.505 --> 18:46.025
Divorce?

236
19:01.545 --> 19:02.665
Hello?

237
19:02.745 --> 19:06.305
Ms. Zheng, you don't have to come to tutor me today.

238
19:07.065 --> 19:08.585
Why the sudden cancelation?

239
19:08.665 --> 19:12.185
I heard your mom will be back tomorrow. What if I tell on you?

240
19:12.785 --> 19:13.705
I'm innocent!

241
19:13.785 --> 19:16.625
I'm busy tonight. Yanzhou is celebrating his birthday.

242
19:16.705 --> 19:18.545
My uncle and aunt called me over.

243
19:18.625 --> 19:20.505
I have to show up.

244
19:20.585 --> 19:22.025
Chen Huimei knows about this.

245
19:22.905 --> 19:24.945
All right, I have to go now.

246
19:25.025 --> 19:26.985
That's all. Don't waste your time coming.

247
19:33.105 --> 19:34.425
Birthday?

248
19:44.625 --> 19:45.945
Why are you staring at me?

249
19:46.545 --> 19:48.505
Who were you lost in conversation with?

250
19:49.705 --> 19:50.625
Ms. Zheng.

251
19:53.025 --> 19:53.865
She…

252
19:55.345 --> 19:56.625
Is she almost here?

253
19:59.385 --> 20:00.865
Don't you have tutoring today?

254
20:01.585 --> 20:04.385
Yanzhou, I came to celebrate your birthday today.

255
20:04.465 --> 20:05.585
Did you forget?

256
20:07.825 --> 20:09.105
I nearly forgot.

257
20:09.185 --> 20:10.265
Tutoring?

258
20:10.345 --> 20:13.545
You will lose your only cousin if I die from exhaustion.

259
20:14.665 --> 20:17.345
Does that mean Ms. Zheng isn't coming today?

260
20:18.025 --> 20:19.425
Of course not. Duh.

261
20:33.785 --> 20:37.065
CHEN YANZHOU

262
20:39.425 --> 20:41.665
Zheng Yu, don't you have tutoring today?

263
20:41.745 --> 20:42.985
Why haven't you left yet?

264
20:43.065 --> 20:44.585
It was canceled at the last minute.

265
20:52.705 --> 20:53.705
What's up, Zheng Yu?

266
20:53.785 --> 20:55.505
What's on your mind?

267
20:57.785 --> 21:00.905
A few days ago, I said some harsh things to a friend.

268
21:00.985 --> 21:02.905
It's their birthday today.

269
21:02.985 --> 21:06.305
Do you think I should still wish them a happy birthday?

270
21:08.825 --> 21:10.585
Why not?

271
21:10.665 --> 21:12.985
If you still think of them as a friend,

272
21:13.065 --> 21:15.505
you can take this chance to bury the hatchet.

273
21:16.505 --> 21:17.825
Maybe

274
21:17.905 --> 21:20.105
they don't want my well-wishes.

275
21:20.185 --> 21:22.345
Maybe they're waiting for them.

276
21:22.425 --> 21:25.425
How will you know the answer if you don't offer any?

277
21:30.865 --> 21:32.425
I have to go out for something.

278
21:43.305 --> 21:45.545
The final dish.

279
21:45.625 --> 21:46.785
We can dig in now.

280
21:47.905 --> 21:49.945
Even if you care about your sick mom,

281
21:50.705 --> 21:52.665
you shouldn't treat yourself this way.

282
22:02.745 --> 22:03.785
Mom.

283
22:04.865 --> 22:07.465
I don't like scrambled eggs with tomatoes now.

284
22:08.265 --> 22:10.305
Didn't you still like it not long ago?

285
22:12.025 --> 22:13.745
People's preferences can change.

286
22:14.345 --> 22:17.025
I can share my preferences, right?

287
22:18.505 --> 22:21.265
-Of course. -Yanzhou, just place it over here.

288
22:21.345 --> 22:22.585
It's no big deal.

289
22:24.505 --> 22:26.385
When can we cut the cake?

290
22:27.265 --> 22:28.785
You're such a glutton.

291
22:33.425 --> 22:35.425
-I'll turn off the light. -Okay.

292
22:38.665 --> 22:41.625
Happy birthday to you

293
22:41.705 --> 22:45.065
Happy birthday to you

294
22:45.145 --> 22:48.745
Happy birthday, happy birthday

295
22:48.825 --> 22:52.345
Happy birthday to you

296
22:53.145 --> 22:54.145
Make a wish.

297
23:00.225 --> 23:01.545
I'll turn on the light.

298
23:05.745 --> 23:06.785
I'll get the door.

299
23:10.785 --> 23:11.705
Grandma?

300
23:11.785 --> 23:13.985
Are you here to celebrate Yanzhou's birthday?

301
23:14.065 --> 23:15.065
Mom.

302
23:15.785 --> 23:18.105
The mangoes were picked too early last time.

303
23:18.185 --> 23:21.145
This time, they're not bad. One batch per family.

304
23:23.305 --> 23:24.225
Mom.

305
23:24.785 --> 23:27.545
Since you're here, sit and join us for dinner.

306
23:31.585 --> 23:33.865
I can't stomach this dinner.

307
23:43.905 --> 23:45.665
Come here.

308
23:45.745 --> 23:47.145
Come. It's okay.

309
23:50.225 --> 23:52.185
Grandma, it's late.

310
23:52.265 --> 23:53.345
It's a long way back.

311
23:53.425 --> 23:56.025
Why don't you stay for the night?

312
23:56.625 --> 23:58.905
Besides, my aunt will be back tomorrow.

313
23:58.985 --> 24:00.785
You haven't seen her lately, right?

314
24:00.865 --> 24:01.785
Yanzhou,

315
24:02.745 --> 24:04.225
you don't need to be so considerate.

316
24:06.345 --> 24:07.545
It's nothing.

317
24:09.545 --> 24:10.985
I'll just ask you this.

318
24:11.745 --> 24:13.065
Is it your birthday today?

319
24:14.305 --> 24:15.785
You don't have to celebrate

320
24:15.865 --> 24:18.265
this fake birthday every year just for your mom.

321
24:20.705 --> 24:22.545
It's just celebrating two days early.

322
24:23.585 --> 24:24.585
As you know,

323
24:25.585 --> 24:26.945
my birthday

324
24:27.785 --> 24:29.465
is the day my brother passed away.

325
24:35.265 --> 24:36.145
I know.

326
24:37.025 --> 24:38.545
The past

327
24:38.625 --> 24:40.425
cannot be changed.

328
24:42.665 --> 24:45.945
So shouldn't we live our lives the way we're meant to?

329
24:46.025 --> 24:48.065
Why does a family need to pretend?

330
24:48.945 --> 24:50.665
You are so hard on yourself.

331
24:50.745 --> 24:52.225
Your mom has no idea.

332
24:52.305 --> 24:53.505
She doesn't know

333
24:54.465 --> 24:56.065
and won't appreciate it.

334
24:59.065 --> 25:00.745
I don't need her to appreciate it

335
25:02.585 --> 25:04.025
as long as she is happy.

336
25:10.425 --> 25:13.545
If you don't want to stay, I'll take you to a nearby hotel.

337
25:57.865 --> 26:00.545
Gao Xing was supposed to have a tutoring session today.

338
26:01.985 --> 26:03.345
She said she canceled it.

339
26:04.705 --> 26:08.025
The next session is next week.

340
26:08.105 --> 26:08.945
I'm…

341
26:09.625 --> 26:12.185
worried she will slack off, so I brought homework.

342
26:14.545 --> 26:15.425
Give it to me.

343
26:35.745 --> 26:37.025
Is this it?

344
26:48.545 --> 26:50.025
Happy birthday.

345
26:56.945 --> 26:58.225
Nothing's happy about it.

346
27:25.785 --> 27:26.625
Hey.

347
27:32.945 --> 27:33.785
Here.

348
27:35.585 --> 27:38.385
I really forgot it last time. I'm not that petty.

349
27:39.385 --> 27:41.985
All right. I'll return it to you after I make a copy.

350
27:42.905 --> 27:44.585
Who's the one acting cool now?

351
27:49.785 --> 27:52.465
Aren't you cold wearing short sleeves in this weather?

352
27:55.825 --> 27:57.025
Do you think I want to?

353
27:57.625 --> 28:00.945
I left my jacket at Yanzhou's house when celebrating his birthday.

354
28:01.025 --> 28:04.105
It so happens that we have an open lecture today,

355
28:04.185 --> 28:05.865
and school uniforms are mandatory.

356
28:05.945 --> 28:07.145
I have to wear this.

357
28:08.785 --> 28:11.105
Who are you kidding? You only have one uniform?

358
28:12.545 --> 28:15.665
I threw my other set in the trash in a fight with Chen Huimei.

359
28:16.505 --> 28:18.105
Chen Huimei?

360
28:19.625 --> 28:20.465
My mom.

361
28:54.105 --> 28:55.225
It's clean.

362
29:00.905 --> 29:04.305
I didn't expect this extortionist to have such a kind side.

363
29:05.865 --> 29:10.185
I… It's a fair exchange. I hope you can be nicer to my sister.

364
29:16.345 --> 29:18.185
I'm super nice to Ms. Zheng.

365
29:18.265 --> 29:19.945
You can ask her yourself.

366
29:20.025 --> 29:22.625
Yanzhou too. He's very nice to Ms. Zheng.

367
29:22.705 --> 29:24.225
Just not quite as nice as me.

368
29:24.305 --> 29:26.305
You probably noticed during that dinner.

369
29:26.385 --> 29:27.585
He actually…

370
29:33.065 --> 29:34.105
What?

371
29:34.185 --> 29:36.025
No taking back what you lent.

372
29:37.025 --> 29:40.665
Last time, you mentioned that you and your cousin live in the same area.

373
29:41.665 --> 29:42.505
Yes.

374
29:43.105 --> 29:45.985
You would rather brave the cold than go get your jacket.

375
29:46.065 --> 29:46.945
Did you lie again?

376
29:48.385 --> 29:50.945
I don't want to go to his house just for this.

377
29:52.265 --> 29:53.825
You just praised him.

378
29:54.545 --> 29:56.865
He is not his house.

379
29:59.265 --> 30:00.425
Sometimes,

380
30:00.505 --> 30:01.945
I'm scared of going there.

381
30:06.785 --> 30:07.865
You wouldn't get it.

382
30:19.225 --> 30:20.385
Are you going out?

383
30:21.385 --> 30:22.785
Where to? It's so early.

384
30:27.905 --> 30:29.305
I'm going

385
30:29.385 --> 30:30.225
to class.

386
30:41.225 --> 30:42.865
-Pang Wei. -Here.

387
30:44.465 --> 30:46.425
-Liu Tianyu. -Here.

388
30:47.905 --> 30:49.865
-Xu Fangli. -Here.

389
30:51.065 --> 30:53.025
-Zhang Qi. -Here.

390
30:54.145 --> 30:55.345
Chen Yanzhou.

391
30:56.665 --> 30:57.945
Is Chen Yanzhou here?

392
31:05.505 --> 31:06.625
That's one absence.

393
31:06.705 --> 31:09.065
If anyone knows him, please pass the word along.

394
31:09.945 --> 31:11.705
A top student skipping class?

395
31:23.705 --> 31:26.065
BELOVED SON ZHOU GUANQI

396
31:28.425 --> 31:29.465
Looks like

397
31:30.305 --> 31:31.865
Dad has come here already.

398
31:45.065 --> 31:46.505
Even if I don't say it,

399
31:46.585 --> 31:48.145
you can probably guess.

400
31:49.465 --> 31:50.545
My paper didn't pass.

401
31:52.105 --> 31:55.345
The reviewer didn't even tell me what the problem is.

402
31:56.385 --> 31:57.425
You're so smart.

403
31:58.025 --> 31:59.505
If you have time,

404
31:59.585 --> 32:01.025
can you help?

405
32:05.425 --> 32:06.785
Never mind.

406
32:07.905 --> 32:09.745
You might be mad after you read it.

407
32:11.905 --> 32:14.265
Mad that I spent so much time

408
32:15.505 --> 32:17.665
and only got this far.

409
32:21.145 --> 32:23.665
Mom, why did we suddenly come here?

410
32:24.665 --> 32:27.985
Don't you miss Daddy? I know, even if you don't tell me.

411
32:28.065 --> 32:30.505
You can tell me next time.

412
32:30.585 --> 32:31.825
I don't want to.

413
32:31.905 --> 32:33.585
No matter what I say,

414
32:33.665 --> 32:35.585
Daddy won't answer anyway.

415
32:37.625 --> 32:41.225
But if we don't talk about him and avoid everything related to him,

416
32:42.025 --> 32:43.905
it's like he never existed.

417
32:43.985 --> 32:46.145
That is what is most heartbreaking.

418
32:46.225 --> 32:49.745
When we miss Daddy, we can say his name often.

419
32:49.825 --> 32:53.825
We can also keep talking about our memories of him.

420
32:53.905 --> 32:57.545
That way, he'll know that we haven't forgotten him.

421
32:57.625 --> 32:59.425
As long as we haven't forgotten him,

422
32:59.505 --> 33:02.465
he will continue to live in another world.

423
33:02.545 --> 33:03.785
Got it?

424
33:10.905 --> 33:12.225
Guanqi.

425
33:14.305 --> 33:16.265
I think it has been a long time

426
33:17.505 --> 33:19.265
since we've talked about you.

427
33:20.385 --> 33:22.185
BELOVED SON

428
33:30.385 --> 33:32.305
CIGARETTES

429
33:45.065 --> 33:45.905
You're back.

430
33:50.585 --> 33:51.625
Why aren't you home?

431
33:54.825 --> 33:56.625
I came to give you this.

432
33:58.225 --> 33:59.545
After this,

433
34:00.465 --> 34:02.025
I have to return to the office.

434
34:14.465 --> 34:15.505
A birthday gift.

435
34:17.385 --> 34:19.304
Today is your actual birthday.

436
34:19.985 --> 34:21.025
I think

437
34:21.625 --> 34:23.425
giving it today is more appropriate.

438
34:27.465 --> 34:29.105
I wish you a happy birthday.

439
34:48.025 --> 34:49.025
Thank you, Dad.

440
35:09.065 --> 35:10.265
You're back.

441
35:13.065 --> 35:16.425
What's the occasion? How come you bought flowers?

442
35:19.265 --> 35:21.185
They're from the flower shop nearby.

443
35:22.025 --> 35:25.745
They're not fresh anymore, but the owner didn't want to toss them.

444
35:25.825 --> 35:29.225
So I bought them for a steal. They should last a few days.

445
35:29.305 --> 35:30.465
They're nice.

446
35:33.865 --> 35:36.865
Mom, if there's nothing you need, I'm going to my room.

447
35:37.865 --> 35:38.905
Okay.

448
35:40.745 --> 35:43.065
Right, Yanzhou.

449
35:44.065 --> 35:45.105
I forgot to say.

450
35:53.905 --> 35:58.705
Do you remember the lady I told you about who collects junk?

451
36:01.465 --> 36:04.905
The one we gave all those old books to.

452
36:05.905 --> 36:07.825
She was delighted when she got them.

453
36:07.905 --> 36:11.265
She even invited me to go fruit-picking at an orchard this weekend.

454
36:14.465 --> 36:15.305
That's sudden.

455
36:15.385 --> 36:17.145
Not really.

456
36:17.225 --> 36:20.185
She's told me before that her husband works at an orchard

457
36:20.265 --> 36:23.225
and to go with her when I had time.

458
36:23.305 --> 36:26.265
She seems to have a tough life, so I didn't turn her down.

459
36:29.065 --> 36:30.145
Yanzhou?

460
36:34.825 --> 36:36.345
Manhuo Orchard, right?

461
36:36.425 --> 36:38.505
Dad is busy and probably won't have time.

462
36:38.585 --> 36:39.505
I'll drive you.

463
36:39.585 --> 36:40.945
You don't have to.

464
36:41.025 --> 36:43.385
You're busy studying and writing a thesis.

465
36:43.465 --> 36:46.625
Don't worry. I already agreed to take the bus with her.

466
36:47.265 --> 36:48.465
Okay.

467
36:49.225 --> 36:51.865
The Route 24 bus right outside should take you there.

468
36:51.945 --> 36:54.625
I've been there for fieldwork before.

469
36:56.185 --> 36:57.145
Really?

470
36:57.825 --> 36:59.185
I see.

471
37:01.105 --> 37:02.265
Is there anything else

472
37:03.145 --> 37:04.625
you want to say?

473
37:05.825 --> 37:07.145
No. Go ahead.

474
37:09.065 --> 37:10.545
Then

475
37:10.625 --> 37:12.385
good night, Mom.

476
37:13.425 --> 37:14.265
Good night.

477
38:04.905 --> 38:07.265
A top student skipping class?

478
38:17.305 --> 38:20.145
CHEN YANZHOU

479
38:22.265 --> 38:23.385
Happy birthday.

480
38:24.825 --> 38:26.425
Nothing's happy about it.

481
38:38.745 --> 38:41.265
QIAN YIWEN

482
38:48.065 --> 38:49.905
Hello? Is this Zheng Yu?

483
38:50.505 --> 38:53.305
I heard you've been looking for part-time gigs again.

484
38:53.385 --> 38:55.545
I want you for a photoshoot this weekend.

485
38:55.625 --> 38:57.065
Are you free?

486
38:57.865 --> 39:00.665
HOUDE HALL

487
39:10.785 --> 39:14.025
Are you on the day shift, while she's on the night shift today?

488
39:20.185 --> 39:23.785
This has been on my mind more than the experiments in the last few days.

489
39:24.385 --> 39:25.825
I clearly remember

490
39:25.905 --> 39:28.865
that the day we went out to buy a gift for the boss,

491
39:28.945 --> 39:29.985
you two were fine.

492
39:30.585 --> 39:32.385
Why did you suddenly have a falling out?

493
39:38.745 --> 39:41.185
Just be honest. How did you piss her off?

494
39:42.185 --> 39:43.345
We're a team.

495
39:43.425 --> 39:45.065
You're a man. Give in to her.

496
39:45.145 --> 39:46.865
Zheng Yu is quite nice.

497
39:47.465 --> 39:48.705
I didn't piss her off.

498
39:50.825 --> 39:51.865
She bullied me.

499
39:56.545 --> 40:00.185
Zheng Yu should really see how miserable you look.

500
40:01.025 --> 40:02.185
She would feel bad.

501
40:20.025 --> 40:21.185
MS. ZHOU

502
40:21.265 --> 40:23.065
I'm waiting for the bus.

503
40:33.825 --> 40:36.185
When my son was 28,

504
40:36.265 --> 40:38.425
he had an accident at a construction site

505
40:38.505 --> 40:39.785
and didn't survive.

506
40:40.745 --> 40:41.625
Over the years,

507
40:41.705 --> 40:46.105
my husband has worked at the orchard to support us.

508
40:49.145 --> 40:50.705
Twenty-eight years old.

509
40:51.905 --> 40:52.785
So young.

510
40:55.625 --> 40:57.545
Life and death are predestined.

511
40:57.625 --> 40:59.865
The young aren't spared from fate.

512
41:01.025 --> 41:03.825
I have to keep looking forward.

513
41:03.905 --> 41:07.145
Sometimes, I have dark thoughts too.

514
41:07.785 --> 41:10.705
So I share what I feel with my family.

515
41:10.785 --> 41:12.905
Sometimes, saying it out loud

516
41:12.985 --> 41:14.705
makes you feel lighter.

517
41:26.265 --> 41:29.065
People should live in the present.

518
41:36.425 --> 41:39.185
You don't have to adjust anything. Just use this filter.

519
41:39.265 --> 41:40.785
This is the shutter.

520
41:40.865 --> 41:42.425
Just press it once.

521
41:42.505 --> 41:43.385
It's done.

522
41:43.465 --> 41:44.785
This is the replay button.

523
41:45.825 --> 41:48.425
That's all. Just pay attention to the composition.

524
41:49.105 --> 41:51.225
Are we just going there to take photos?

525
41:52.305 --> 41:54.105
Is it weird that I asked you along?

526
41:55.265 --> 41:56.345
A bit.

527
41:56.425 --> 41:58.785
I just want someone to take photos for me.

528
41:58.865 --> 42:00.425
The others don't like doing it.

529
42:00.505 --> 42:03.265
If I invited them and kept asking them to take photos,

530
42:03.345 --> 42:04.345
I would feel bad.

531
42:04.425 --> 42:07.025
So it's better to ask a stranger.

532
42:07.985 --> 42:08.985
I sort of get it.

533
42:09.945 --> 42:11.865
Manhuo Orchard is still ages away.

534
42:11.945 --> 42:13.185
You can take a nap.

535
42:13.265 --> 42:14.785
You have serious dark circles.

536
42:28.785 --> 42:31.105
Chen Yanzhou, let's grab a bite.

537
42:31.185 --> 42:32.785
No. I have no appetite.

538
42:35.465 --> 42:39.105
I'll go with you. I'm starving. He's busy later. Right?

539
42:41.825 --> 42:42.785
Let's go.

540
42:46.985 --> 42:51.465
MS. ZHOU I'M WAITING FOR THE BUS.

541
42:53.105 --> 42:54.865
I was working on experiments.

542
42:55.705 --> 42:57.825
Is the trip going well?

543
43:12.105 --> 43:12.945
Hello.

544
43:13.545 --> 43:14.705
Mom, where are you now?

545
43:16.225 --> 43:18.065
Just past Innovation Industrial Park.

546
43:20.185 --> 43:21.625
You didn't reply to my text.

547
43:21.705 --> 43:23.825
I called just in case you missed your stop.

548
43:25.025 --> 43:26.305
I don't go out often,

549
43:26.385 --> 43:29.065
but I know how to read bus stop signs.

550
43:29.145 --> 43:30.265
What if you dozed off?

551
43:32.785 --> 43:34.585
That is possible.

552
43:36.505 --> 43:39.785
I used to always look down, volunteering and picking up trash with everyone.

553
43:40.665 --> 43:43.745
Now I've realized that our city is very beautiful.

554
43:43.825 --> 43:45.705
It's so scenic.

555
43:46.425 --> 43:48.465
If you like it, I'll tell Dad.

556
43:48.545 --> 43:49.705
In the future,

557
43:50.665 --> 43:51.905
we can go out more often.

558
43:52.505 --> 43:53.425
Sure.

559
43:54.065 --> 43:55.785
Let's all go out together.

560
43:57.585 --> 43:59.345
By the way, have you eaten yet?

561
43:59.425 --> 44:00.945
Doing experiments is tiring,

562
44:01.025 --> 44:02.945
but don't forget to eat.

563
44:04.905 --> 44:05.825
Hello?

564
44:06.865 --> 44:07.785
Hello?
